    <detaileddescription>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthrust_1_1project1st" kindref="compound">project1st</ref></computeroutput> is a function object that takes two arguments and returns its first argument; the second argument is unused. It is essentially a generalization of identity to the case of a Binary Function.</para>
